{c: Verse 1}
[Fm] Kisse poochoon hai aisa kyun,        [A#m] Bezubaan sa yeh [Fm] jahaan hai
Khushi ke [Fm] pal kahan [C#] dhoondhoon,        [A#m] Benishaan sa waqt hi [Fm] yahan hai
Jaane [C#] kitne lub pe [Fm] giley hai,        Zinda [C#] gi se kai [Fm] faasley hai
[A#m] Usey jeete hai sapne kyun [Fm] aankho me,        [A#m] Lakeere chootey jab inn [Fm] haathon se
[A#m] Bewajah,        Jo bheji [Fm] thi duaa
Woh jaake [C#] aasmaan,        Se yoon [D#] takra gayi
Ke aa gayi hai [G#] laut ke sadaa,        Jo bheji [Fm] thi duaa
Woh jaake [C#] aasmaan,        Se yoon [D#] takra gayi
Ke aa gayi hai [G#] laut ke sadaa,        [Fm] Saanson ne kaha rookh modh liya
Koi [C#] raah nazar mein na aaye,        [Fm] Dhadhkan ne kaha dil chodh diya
Kahan [D#] chodey inn jismon ke saaye,        Yahi [G#] baar baar sochta hoon
[C#] Tanha main yahan,        Mere [G#] saath saath chal raha hai
[Fm] Yaadon ka dhuaan,        Jo bheji [Fm] thi duaa
